{"id":999,"date":"2023-09-26T21:02:51","date_gmt":"2023-09-27T04:02:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/?p=999"},"modified":"2023-09-26T21:03:35","modified_gmt":"2023-09-27T04:03:35","slug":"new-feature-pdf-export","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/blog\/new-feature-pdf-export\/","title":{"rendered":"New Feature: PDF Export!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>In the ever-evolving landscape of game development, the need for efficient and comprehensive documentation has never been more crucial. The ability to capture every detail of your game project, from concept to execution, is the linchpin of success. Today, I am thrilled to announce a game-changing addition to our Game Design Documentation service: the <strong>PDF Export of Game Projects<\/strong> feature! Now you can export your game into a PDF Game Design Document, with a click of a button.<\/p>\n<h2>Effortless Project Summaries<\/h2>\n<p>The PDF Export feature takes the hassle out of summarizing your game project. No more juggling multiple documents, screenshots, or lengthy explanations. Instead, you can now generate a concise, beautifully formatted PDF that encapsulates every aspect of your game, making it perfect for presentations, pitching to stakeholders, or archiving your development journey.<\/p>\n<h2>Polished and Professional<\/h2>\n<p>First impressions matter, and a professionally designed PDF can make a world of difference. With our PDF Export feature, your game project will shine. It automatically generates clean, visually appealing layouts that showcase your game&#8217;s concept, design, mechanics, characters, and much more. It&#8217;s like having a dedicated graphic designer at your fingertips!<\/p>\n<h2>How It Works<\/h2>\n<p>Using the PDF Export feature is as easy. Simply navigate to your project, select the <strong>Tools &gt; Export<\/strong> option, and download the PDF. Presto!<\/p>\n<p>To learn more, check out the <a href=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/features\/export-project\/\">Export Feature<\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>In the ever-evolving landscape of game development, the need for efficient and comprehensive documentation has never been more crucial. The ability to capture every detail of your game project, from concept to execution, is the linchpin of success. Today, I am thrilled to announce a game-changing addition to our Game Design Documentation service: the PDF [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":879,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"content-type":"","_genesis_hide_title":false,"_genesis_hide_breadcrumbs":false,"_genesis_hide_singular_image":false,"_genesis_hide_footer_widgets":false,"_genesis_custom_body_class":"","_genesis_custom_post_class":"","_genesis_layout":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[25],"tags":[],"coauthors":[4],"class_list":["post-999","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","category-gamescrye","entry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>New Feature: PDF Export! - Gamescrye Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"In the ever-evolving landscape of game development, the need for efficient and comprehensive documentation has never been more crucial. The ability to\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/blog\/new-feature-pdf-export\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"New Feature: PDF Export! - Gamescrye Blog\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"In the ever-evolving landscape of game development, the need for efficient and comprehensive documentation has 